1
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:08,920
‪SAY NO TO PIRACY SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:35,320 --> 00:01:37,120
‪ADAPTED FROM <i>‪JIA JIN CHAI</i>‪,

3
00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:38,920
‪ORIGINAL NOVEL
‪BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

4
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:43,440
A-Chou.

5
00:01:44,960 --> 00:01:46,360
What else do you have to say?

6
00:01:47,520 --> 00:01:48,840
I have nothing to say.

7
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:52,800
Guards!

8
00:01:53,520 --> 00:01:54,760
- Take her…
- Stop!

9
00:02:09,720 --> 00:02:10,600
Brother Jue!

10
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:12,640
Grandmother is still sick.

11
00:02:12,720 --> 00:02:14,200
How dare you disturb her?

12
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:16,720
Something so serious happened at home.

13
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:19,520
If she isn't here, things might end badly.

14
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:21,360
I had no choice but to put that aside.

15
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:25,120
There's no conclusion to this matter yet.

16
00:02:25,200 --> 00:02:27,680
Why are you in a rush
to pin the crime on someone?

17
00:02:29,640 --> 00:02:32,720
Lady Shou'an.
She forged the Longlife Lock.

18
00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:35,280
The witness has overturned her testimony,
and the bribe is right before us.

19
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:38,760
The crime of deceiving an emperor
deserves more than a hundred deaths.

20
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:40,360
Are you going to plead for her?

21
00:02:40,440 --> 00:02:45,400
It's difficult to judge an old case,
but that doesn't mean it's impossible.

22
00:02:46,440 --> 00:02:47,840
She was right.

23
00:02:48,440 --> 00:02:50,080
The Longevity Lock was forged,

24
00:02:50,160 --> 00:02:54,320
but the clothes, shoes,
and socks are real.

25
00:02:55,200 --> 00:02:58,640
Besides, even though the wet nurse
and the guard are dead,

26
00:02:58,720 --> 00:03:01,160
there's still a possibility that
they were silenced.

27
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:03,600
As long as there are any doubts,
we must investigate it.

28
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:06,560
The truth must come to light.

29
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:10,240
- Mother.
- I don't want to talk to you.

30
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:13,320
Look at all of you.

31
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:17,680
Each and every one of you is so keen

32
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:20,200
for her demise.

33
00:03:20,280 --> 00:03:22,240
What are you trying to do?

34
00:03:22,320 --> 00:03:23,960
Maternal Grandmother!

35
00:03:24,040 --> 00:03:25,680
She took my title and my identity!

36
00:03:25,760 --> 00:03:27,000
She's backing me into a corner.

37
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:29,840
Mother. Listen.

38
00:03:29,920 --> 00:03:31,520
Maternal Grandmother must be too senile

39
00:03:32,120 --> 00:03:33,320
for her to say those words.

40
00:03:37,200 --> 00:03:38,280
Old Madam Wei,

41
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:42,120
their judgment might be clouded,
but you are wise.

42
00:03:42,760 --> 00:03:45,560
How could you entertain them
in this farce?

43
00:03:45,640 --> 00:03:50,480
Are you going
to take the word of a fickle wretch

44
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:55,560
and a few strings of worthless coins
to simply declare her guilty?

45
00:03:55,640 --> 00:04:01,760
She is the only offspring left behind
by that dearest son of yours.

46
00:04:02,760 --> 00:04:05,560
Aren't you going
to investigate this thoroughly first

47
00:04:05,640 --> 00:04:08,640
to give Wei Jin's soul some justice?

48
00:04:11,040 --> 00:04:12,160
Look.

49
00:04:12,760 --> 00:04:15,000
A girl as delicate as a flower.

50
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:16,720
How could you?

51
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:19,200
How could you bear to do it, Old Madam?

52
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:23,000
I can't bear to do it.

53
00:04:24,520 --> 00:04:26,160
I can't bring myself to do it.

54
00:04:27,400 --> 00:04:29,520
But there's evidence.

55
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:31,360
You call that evidence?

56
00:04:31,440 --> 00:04:32,360
He can forge one today,

57
00:04:32,440 --> 00:04:34,440
and they can forge
something else tomorrow.

58
00:04:34,520 --> 00:04:37,720
Evidence is dead,
but she is a living person.

59
00:04:40,080 --> 00:04:41,280
She mustn't be killed.

60
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:43,000
No one touches her.

61
00:04:50,400 --> 00:04:51,360
Guards.

62
00:04:52,320 --> 00:04:53,800
Take her away for now.

63
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:57,360
Once I investigate this thoroughly,
I will make a decision.

64
00:04:57,960 --> 00:04:59,680
- Maternal Grandmother!
- Lady Shou'an!

65
00:05:00,280 --> 00:05:04,520
She used her title as a noble lady
to raise troops and gain support.

66
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:06,160
She has 500 men now.

67
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:08,200
If you don't strike
before she grows too powerful,

68
00:05:08,280 --> 00:05:10,480
you will never get
another chance in the future.

69
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:13,800
An outsider has no right
to question my decision.

70
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:17,840
Huo Jue, go.

71
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:18,800
Yes.

72
00:05:21,760 --> 00:05:24,240
My Lady, I have no choice
but to put you through this.

73
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:26,320
This way.

74
00:06:10,880 --> 00:06:12,040
This is serious.

75
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:13,800
Any leaks bring trouble.

76
00:06:13,880 --> 00:06:17,320
Everyone, please stay here as guests

77
00:06:17,400 --> 00:06:20,040
and allow me to welcome
all of you as the host.

78
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:33,640
You betrayed me!

79
00:06:38,840 --> 00:06:40,560
I'm only going to ask you one thing.

80
00:06:42,280 --> 00:06:44,400
Grandmother only had a cold.

81
00:06:45,520 --> 00:06:48,480
Why did you burn
such a strong calming incense?

82
00:06:48,560 --> 00:06:53,040
The physician told many times
that she was to stay in bed to recuperate.

83
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:57,160
The medicine and incense used
were all based on the prescription.

84
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:58,440
How is that my fault too?

85
00:06:58,520 --> 00:07:01,000
I hope you are telling the truth.

86
00:07:01,080 --> 00:07:02,480
- I'm really afraid…
- Liar.

87
00:07:03,080 --> 00:07:05,400
You kept saying that
everything you did was for my sake.

88
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:08,240
You said you would do anything for me.

89
00:07:08,880 --> 00:07:10,080
Lies.

90
00:07:13,120 --> 00:07:15,000
I'm tired. You may leave.

91
00:07:15,080 --> 00:07:17,000
I know about many things,

92
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:20,600
but I pretended to be blind.

93
00:07:21,200 --> 00:07:22,480
I pretended to be a fool.

94
00:07:23,080 --> 00:07:24,560
I kept covering for you,

95
00:07:24,640 --> 00:07:26,640
but I would never allow you
to harm Maternal Grandmother.

96
00:07:27,600 --> 00:07:29,480
This is against humanity.

97
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:32,640
You're on your own now.

98
00:07:38,320 --> 00:07:41,480
Indecisive and sanctimonious.

99
00:07:43,120 --> 00:07:44,480
I knew he couldn't be trusted.

100
00:07:45,320 --> 00:07:46,560
They are all liars.

101
00:07:47,080 --> 00:07:47,920
Rao.

102
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:52,240
Aunt Yufeng, why are you here?

103
00:07:57,280 --> 00:07:59,400
Please sit. Let me get someone
to serve you sugarcane juice.

104
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:01,760
No need.

105
00:08:02,520 --> 00:08:04,360
I'm just a little worried about you.

106
00:08:04,880 --> 00:08:08,200
What do you plan to do next?

107
00:08:09,760 --> 00:08:11,640
That wretch has been captured.

108
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:13,360
It'll be easy to kill her.

109
00:08:13,440 --> 00:08:14,920
What are you even worried about,
Aunt Yufeng?

110
00:08:16,440 --> 00:08:17,760
Silly child.

111
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:20,960
Although she was captured,

112
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:24,560
once the news
reaches the Duke's Residence,

113
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:29,120
Lu Zhuo will never give up easily.

114
00:08:29,200 --> 00:08:31,480
He will never do anything
with my mother around.

115
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:36,200
Don't think you can rest assured
just because you have evidence.

116
00:08:37,039 --> 00:08:42,200
Besides eating, a person's mouth
can be used to accuse others.

117
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:47,320
It only takes an instant
to go against one's words.

118
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:49,920
Don't forget.

119
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:53,560
She's not some housewife
you can push around.

120
00:08:54,840 --> 00:08:57,240
She is Noble Lady Wu'an,

121
00:08:58,360 --> 00:08:59,920
who is loved by the refugees.

122
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:09,480
Just wait and see.

123
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:13,480
If she hasn't returned by dawn,

124
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:18,280
someone will rally the refugees
to make a scene.

125
00:09:18,920 --> 00:09:20,040
When the time comes,

126
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:23,320
even Lady Li will have no choice
but to release her,

127
00:09:24,800 --> 00:09:27,000
in spite of her reluctance.

128
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:33,280
She really shouldn't be given
the title of a noble.

129
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:34,600
She's such a nuisance.

130
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:38,400
What should we do now, Aunt Yufeng?

131
00:09:43,520 --> 00:09:45,600
If you don't deal
with the trouble at its roots,

132
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:48,440
it'll only cause further trouble.

133
00:10:00,960 --> 00:10:03,840
XIANZHUANG

134
00:10:04,640 --> 00:10:06,000
Fu.

135
00:10:07,280 --> 00:10:09,520
You've always been bright
and have a mind of your own.

136
00:10:10,120 --> 00:10:12,160
I've never interfered,

137
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:16,080
but this time, you were too reckless.

138
00:10:17,200 --> 00:10:20,560
Mother, there was solid evidence.

139
00:10:20,640 --> 00:10:22,600
She was stumped,

140
00:10:22,680 --> 00:10:25,960
but you kept defending

141
00:10:26,680 --> 00:10:28,720
and protecting her time and again.

142
00:10:28,800 --> 00:10:33,280
Are you not afraid of upsetting Rao
and hurting your relationship with her?

143
00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:35,160
I'm not afraid of anything.

144
00:10:37,040 --> 00:10:40,320
I'm just afraid that you, my daughter,
will regret doing this.

145
00:10:42,960 --> 00:10:45,680
You think A-Chou is the real Wei Rao?

146
00:10:46,360 --> 00:10:48,880
I've seen many people in my life.

147
00:10:49,520 --> 00:10:51,760
The Wei Rao who grew up
in the Earl of Cheng'an's Residence

148
00:10:51,840 --> 00:10:54,880
was born with a vicious
and cruel personality.

149
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:57,360
She's unlike you or Wei Jin.

150
00:10:58,320 --> 00:10:59,600
It's all my fault.

151
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:05,600
She only turned this way
without a mother to guide and counsel her.

152
00:11:06,600 --> 00:11:11,080
I've lived in the palace for many years
and have been away from my daughter.

153
00:11:12,160 --> 00:11:15,200
But her grandmother and uncle
are at Wei Residence.

154
00:11:15,280 --> 00:11:17,240
She also has servants to serve her.

155
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:19,320
There's no way they didn't recognize her.

156
00:11:19,400 --> 00:11:20,920
You said she was unlike me.

157
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:24,560
Does A-Chou feel like
my biological daughter instead?

158
00:11:25,360 --> 00:11:28,920
She's like you and unlike you
at the same time.

159
00:11:30,080 --> 00:11:32,760
Mother, hearing you say that
confuses me even more.

160
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:36,040
She is decisive and confident.

161
00:11:37,280 --> 00:11:40,040
Her ambitions and shrewdness
are qualities that resemble yours.

162
00:11:41,160 --> 00:11:46,080
But she is smarter, more benevolent,
and cares more about others than you do.

163
00:11:46,160 --> 00:11:49,520
These qualities
are like her father, Wei Jin.

164
00:11:53,280 --> 00:11:54,320
Mother.

165
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:56,240
Are you that sure?

166
00:11:57,280 --> 00:12:00,760
Meet that child alone.

167
00:12:00,840 --> 00:12:03,680
Have a good chat with just the two of you.

168
00:12:05,280 --> 00:12:06,120
Mother.

169
00:12:07,600 --> 00:12:08,600
Let me…

170
00:12:10,280 --> 00:12:11,880
Let me think this through.

171
00:12:11,960 --> 00:12:14,200
Why are you even hesitating?

172
00:12:14,280 --> 00:12:17,000
Why do you keep avoiding this
and walk around in circles?

173
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:20,480
Being afraid of a child
is unlike you, is it not?

174
00:12:20,560 --> 00:12:22,440
This isn't like you at all.

175
00:12:47,040 --> 00:12:48,360
- Who is it?
- My Lord!

176
00:12:51,760 --> 00:12:53,400
My Lord, something has happened
to Noble Lady Wu'an.

177
00:12:53,480 --> 00:12:55,960
Lady Li abducted her
while you were escorting His Majesty.

178
00:12:56,840 --> 00:12:58,480
Didn't you submit the evidence?

179
00:12:58,560 --> 00:13:00,280
We told them everything,
but no one believed us.

180
00:13:00,880 --> 00:13:02,360
She said the Longlife Lock was fake.

181
00:13:02,440 --> 00:13:05,600
That animal, Lv Lun, went against his word
and betrayed Noble Lady Wu'an.

182
00:13:05,680 --> 00:13:08,240
Lady Shou'an tried to stop them,
but I'm afraid it will be futile.

183
00:13:08,320 --> 00:13:10,240
Tomorrow at dawn,
they will execute Noble Lady Wu'an.

184
00:13:13,000 --> 00:13:14,080
- Zhao Bai.
- Yes.

185
00:13:14,160 --> 00:13:16,120
Gather the men and head to Xianzhuang.
Zhao Song.

186
00:13:16,200 --> 00:13:17,600
- Lead the army back to camp.
- Yes.

187
00:13:24,920 --> 00:13:27,600
<i>Wei Rao, wait for me. I will be there.</i>

188
00:14:03,160 --> 00:14:05,040
It's heavily guarded here.

189
00:14:05,120 --> 00:14:05,960
How did you come in?

190
00:14:06,040 --> 00:14:08,040
I am Lady Li's dearest daughter.

191
00:14:08,640 --> 00:14:10,200
Do you think
the imperial army can stop me?

192
00:14:23,960 --> 00:14:26,240
Her indenture contract was burnt…

193
00:14:28,440 --> 00:14:30,880
but I still have her parents and siblings.

194
00:14:31,600 --> 00:14:33,800
They are her close ones after all.

195
00:14:33,880 --> 00:14:39,360
I'm sure she can't disregard their lives
and swear loyalty to you.

196
00:14:41,560 --> 00:14:43,560
It's only natural.

197
00:14:44,640 --> 00:14:46,200
You need to forgive her.

198
00:14:48,040 --> 00:14:49,160
Am I right, Bitao?

199
00:14:53,840 --> 00:14:56,040
Oh, I've been talking away.

200
00:14:56,760 --> 00:14:59,080
You must be hungry. Let's eat first.

201
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:13,000
What? Are you afraid that
I might poison you?

202
00:15:43,200 --> 00:15:44,840
You're not the only victim here.

203
00:15:46,200 --> 00:15:47,080
Yes.

204
00:15:48,720 --> 00:15:50,560
I did grow up in a rich background.

205
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:53,760
But Grandmother is old.

206
00:15:53,840 --> 00:15:54,880
She can't take good care of me.

207
00:15:55,960 --> 00:15:58,320
The servants fawned on the powerful
and looked down on the weak.

208
00:15:58,400 --> 00:16:00,320
They bullied me
for having no parents to rely on.

209
00:16:00,840 --> 00:16:04,200
They kept finding ways
to take things away from me

210
00:16:05,920 --> 00:16:08,040
to line their pockets.

211
00:16:15,040 --> 00:16:16,320
I'm just going to share this with you.

212
00:16:16,400 --> 00:16:21,400
Someone called Governess Luo
gave me less food when I was sick.

213
00:16:21,480 --> 00:16:24,960
She told Grandmother that
I needed to fast for the sake of recovery.

214
00:16:25,920 --> 00:16:27,480
When I recovered,

215
00:16:28,040 --> 00:16:30,920
I lured her to the pond in the garden.

216
00:16:34,280 --> 00:16:35,800
Then, I pushed her into the pond.

217
00:16:39,480 --> 00:16:41,000
Why are you telling me all this?

218
00:16:44,120 --> 00:16:46,000
I know you hate Mother.

219
00:16:46,080 --> 00:16:47,440
I hate her too.

220
00:16:49,800 --> 00:16:52,040
She left me alone in the residence.

221
00:16:53,520 --> 00:16:55,720
I was very lonely and afraid.

222
00:16:55,800 --> 00:16:58,600
Everyone sided with Third Sister
and bullied me.

223
00:16:59,360 --> 00:17:00,200
I won't take that silently.

224
00:17:00,960 --> 00:17:04,680
All of those who bullied me
and took things from me must pay.

225
00:17:05,920 --> 00:17:09,520
I've never said this to others.

226
00:17:10,359 --> 00:17:12,160
Because they won't understand.

227
00:17:17,000 --> 00:17:17,960
But you do.

228
00:17:18,760 --> 00:17:19,960
You understand.

229
00:17:20,480 --> 00:17:21,760
After all,

230
00:17:23,440 --> 00:17:25,160
you have it rougher than I do.

231
00:17:26,480 --> 00:17:28,840
You are alone with no one to rely on.

232
00:17:28,920 --> 00:17:30,640
No one has ever loved you.

233
00:17:31,240 --> 00:17:33,920
The result has been decided,
and our identities are confirmed.

234
00:17:34,720 --> 00:17:36,760
I don't really need to kill you.

235
00:17:37,360 --> 00:17:41,000
As long as you promise me
to leave the capital and never return,

236
00:17:42,200 --> 00:17:46,080
I can beg Mother to spare your life.

237
00:17:48,880 --> 00:17:50,080
Bitao.

238
00:18:16,800 --> 00:18:19,200
This is the Double Cavity Pot.

239
00:18:19,280 --> 00:18:20,200
XIANZHUANG

240
00:18:20,280 --> 00:18:25,680
There's a hidden mechanism inside
that can help Rao get her wish.

241
00:18:28,960 --> 00:18:30,920
You know what to do.

242
00:18:40,840 --> 00:18:41,880
You fool!

243
00:18:43,560 --> 00:18:44,720
You can't even do such a simple thing?

244
00:18:51,480 --> 00:18:52,480
You are not doing anything wrong.

245
00:18:54,440 --> 00:18:55,800
Everyone has to look out for themselves.

246
00:19:09,600 --> 00:19:13,320
You are not the one who decides my fate.

247
00:19:16,480 --> 00:19:17,560
Don't feel guilty.

248
00:19:31,640 --> 00:19:32,680
You mean it?

249
00:19:33,960 --> 00:19:36,080
As long as you promise me,
I won't trouble you.

250
00:19:43,640 --> 00:19:45,120
Let this cup of wine be our pledge.

251
00:19:46,600 --> 00:19:47,720
It's a promise.

252
00:20:19,200 --> 00:20:21,400
I've never seen someone as stupid as you.

253
00:20:22,720 --> 00:20:25,880
A few words from me,
and you trusted me completely.

254
00:20:26,920 --> 00:20:28,000
Did you know what you drank?

255
00:20:28,560 --> 00:20:30,360
It's poisonous wine!

256
00:20:33,720 --> 00:20:35,480
You fool!

257
00:20:52,840 --> 00:20:55,080
XIANZHUANG

258
00:21:03,600 --> 00:21:05,120
We have imperial orders
to seal off the manor.

259
00:21:05,200 --> 00:21:06,680
No one can enter this place
without being summoned.

260
00:21:06,760 --> 00:21:08,480
My Lord, please don't cause us trouble.

261
00:21:09,360 --> 00:21:10,960
What if I insist on doing that?

262
00:21:25,680 --> 00:21:26,520
Rao!

263
00:21:27,880 --> 00:21:29,280
Rao!

264
00:21:29,360 --> 00:21:30,960
Rao, wake up!

265
00:21:31,040 --> 00:21:32,640
Don't scare me, Rao! Rao!

266
00:21:34,080 --> 00:21:36,400
How did you… Rao!

267
00:21:36,480 --> 00:21:38,920
Don't scare me. Rao!

268
00:21:43,080 --> 00:21:44,080
Rao…

269
00:21:47,360 --> 00:21:50,360
You murderer! Return Rao to me!

270
00:21:50,440 --> 00:21:52,360
Return Rao to me!

271
00:21:52,440 --> 00:21:54,960
No. Lady Wei Rao wanted
to poison Noble Lady Wu'an,

272
00:21:55,560 --> 00:21:56,960
but something went wrong.

273
00:21:57,040 --> 00:21:58,800
She ended up drinking
the poisoned wine instead.

274
00:21:58,880 --> 00:22:00,200
Noble Lady Wu'an
has nothing to do with this.

275
00:22:00,280 --> 00:22:02,560
Lady Wei Rao was the one
who brought the poisoned wine.

276
00:22:02,640 --> 00:22:04,240
You can just test the wine.

277
00:22:04,320 --> 00:22:06,520
You traitorous servant!

278
00:22:06,600 --> 00:22:08,120
You'll die a cruel death!

279
00:22:12,560 --> 00:22:13,760
Lady Li!

280
00:22:13,840 --> 00:22:15,240
Lady Li!

281
00:22:15,320 --> 00:22:16,320
Lady Li!

282
00:22:17,960 --> 00:22:19,640
I am Rao's aunt.

283
00:22:20,320 --> 00:22:24,280
Seeing Rao die such a tragic death
devastates me,

284
00:22:24,360 --> 00:22:27,480
let alone you, her biological mother.

285
00:22:27,560 --> 00:22:28,600
Lady Li.

286
00:22:28,680 --> 00:22:30,200
You must avenge her.

287
00:22:30,280 --> 00:22:32,760
Kill this woman. Kill her!

288
00:22:57,720 --> 00:22:59,040
Did you do this?

289
00:23:00,760 --> 00:23:03,080
Yes. It was her!

290
00:23:03,160 --> 00:23:04,320
She did it, Lady Li!

291
00:23:05,080 --> 00:23:06,800
Why are you hesitating?

292
00:23:06,880 --> 00:23:08,960
Kill her right now!

293
00:23:09,040 --> 00:23:10,560
I did it.

294
00:23:12,000 --> 00:23:13,200
She tried to kill me with poisoned wine.

295
00:23:14,160 --> 00:23:16,800
I only returned the favor.

296
00:23:17,720 --> 00:23:18,720
I did it.

297
00:23:19,720 --> 00:23:20,680
You…

298
00:23:21,280 --> 00:23:22,320
You…

299
00:23:24,120 --> 00:23:26,120
Noble Lady Wu'an,
this has nothing to do with you.

300
00:23:26,200 --> 00:23:27,720
How could you admit it?

301
00:23:30,400 --> 00:23:32,280
I've suffered injustices for 16 years.

302
00:23:33,720 --> 00:23:37,720
I walked a long, long way alone.

303
00:23:39,680 --> 00:23:41,920
I've suffered so much.

304
00:23:43,400 --> 00:23:45,560
I thought I finally found my mother,

305
00:23:46,200 --> 00:23:48,760
and everything would start
to go well for me.

306
00:23:48,840 --> 00:23:50,920
No one would ever bully me again.

307
00:23:52,320 --> 00:23:54,240
But my mother tried to kill me.

308
00:23:58,080 --> 00:23:59,440
Aren't you going to kill me?

309
00:24:00,960 --> 00:24:02,480
Do it now!

310
00:24:11,640 --> 00:24:13,080
Do it, Lady Li.

311
00:24:14,000 --> 00:24:15,920
I beg you to kill her.

312
00:24:16,600 --> 00:24:18,360
Do it, Lady Li!

313
00:24:20,280 --> 00:24:22,640
Hurry, Lady Li!

314
00:24:25,160 --> 00:24:26,800
Let me do it! I'll kill you!

315
00:24:26,880 --> 00:24:28,400
- I'll kill you!
- Stop her!

316
00:24:51,880 --> 00:24:53,480
What are all of you doing?

317
00:24:54,520 --> 00:24:56,800
Don't you have a heart?

318
00:24:57,720 --> 00:24:59,680
Why didn't you kill her?

319
00:24:59,760 --> 00:25:02,120
Why didn't you kill her?

320
00:25:04,000 --> 00:25:06,720
Kill her!

321
00:25:08,120 --> 00:25:09,200
Rao!

322
00:25:09,280 --> 00:25:10,440
Rao!

323
00:25:10,520 --> 00:25:12,400
Rao!

324
00:25:13,880 --> 00:25:14,720
Rao!

325
00:25:14,800 --> 00:25:15,960
This is…

326
00:25:16,880 --> 00:25:19,320
How did this happen?

327
00:25:19,400 --> 00:25:22,720
How did things come to this tragedy
where no one stands to win?

328
00:25:24,240 --> 00:25:26,520
All of you are muddled! Muddled!

329
00:25:27,320 --> 00:25:28,200
Lady Li!

330
00:25:29,040 --> 00:25:31,640
Are you going to

331
00:25:32,440 --> 00:25:36,840
see Rao die such a tragic death
without avenging her?

332
00:25:37,680 --> 00:25:40,560
Are you not going to kill this woman?

333
00:25:46,240 --> 00:25:47,480
What's going on?

334
00:25:48,800 --> 00:25:51,840
Lu Zhuo, what are you trying to do?

335
00:25:54,160 --> 00:25:55,000
This isn't the place to talk.

336
00:25:56,000 --> 00:25:57,520
We'll speak in the hall.

337
00:26:02,880 --> 00:26:03,960
Bring him here.

338
00:26:04,040 --> 00:26:09,120
DEEP CLOUDS, TWILIGHT SEAS

339
00:26:14,840 --> 00:26:15,920
Do you recognize him?

340
00:26:16,760 --> 00:26:17,800
The bandits' vice leader

341
00:26:17,880 --> 00:26:19,520
who ruled South Mountain for 20 years.

342
00:26:19,600 --> 00:26:21,600
A ruthless killer who stops at nothing.

343
00:26:22,560 --> 00:26:23,720
They rob traveling merchants,

344
00:26:24,520 --> 00:26:26,440
yet the imperial court
fails to catch them.

345
00:26:26,520 --> 00:26:29,280
Their bounties have been posted
at the castle gates all year round.

346
00:26:29,960 --> 00:26:32,720
That head just now
belonged to the leader, Fushan.

347
00:26:33,320 --> 00:26:34,440
As for this…

348
00:26:35,280 --> 00:26:36,320
Tuhu.

349
00:26:37,080 --> 00:26:38,480
16 years ago,

350
00:26:38,560 --> 00:26:40,200
you said a man
carried gold up the mountain

351
00:26:41,000 --> 00:26:42,760
and hired you lot to kill someone.

352
00:26:44,760 --> 00:26:46,480
Every favored servant
of the Wei family is here.

353
00:26:46,560 --> 00:26:47,640
Who was the one…

354
00:26:50,640 --> 00:26:51,800
who hired you to kill?

355
00:27:10,160 --> 00:27:13,160
Him! I remember the man
has a mole near his chin.

356
00:27:13,920 --> 00:27:15,080
It's him. I'm sure.

357
00:27:15,840 --> 00:27:17,160
He paid us to kill a man and a woman.

358
00:27:26,040 --> 00:27:27,000
Speak.

359
00:27:27,560 --> 00:27:28,960
What do they look like?

360
00:27:30,080 --> 00:27:31,640
Many years have passed.

361
00:27:31,720 --> 00:27:32,560
I don't remember.

362
00:27:34,120 --> 00:27:36,360
That man was limping.

363
00:27:36,440 --> 00:27:37,600
I think he was a cripple.

364
00:27:38,320 --> 00:27:40,680
As for the woman,
she was soft and delicate.

365
00:27:41,400 --> 00:27:42,520
She also spoke with a Yingchuan accent.

366
00:27:44,000 --> 00:27:45,280
Yingchuan accent?

367
00:27:47,400 --> 00:27:51,200
Liu, Rao's wet nurse back then,
was from Yingchuan.

368
00:27:52,040 --> 00:27:55,360
The guards lost Rao
and were flogged 40 times as punishment.

369
00:27:55,440 --> 00:27:58,040
Hence, all of them had difficulty walking.

370
00:27:59,280 --> 00:28:00,520
Take him away.

371
00:28:09,240 --> 00:28:10,320
Speak.

372
00:28:20,640 --> 00:28:23,960
If you are not going to be honest,
your head will roll.

373
00:28:25,040 --> 00:28:27,920
No matter how rich you are,
you won't be alive to enjoy your wealth.

374
00:28:28,880 --> 00:28:30,280
It was Lady Heng'e.

375
00:28:30,360 --> 00:28:33,280
She forced me to hire them.

376
00:28:33,920 --> 00:28:34,880
What nonsense?

377
00:28:35,480 --> 00:28:36,640
Don't make things up!

378
00:28:36,720 --> 00:28:37,680
I didn't do it!

379
00:28:38,520 --> 00:28:39,520
It's not me!

380
00:28:40,120 --> 00:28:42,000
I'm sure Lv Lun was bought off.

381
00:28:42,800 --> 00:28:46,800
Lu Zhuo's pulling out everything
to save this killer.

382
00:28:46,880 --> 00:28:47,760
How can it be me?

383
00:28:48,360 --> 00:28:51,200
Lady Li. I didn't do it.

384
00:28:51,280 --> 00:28:52,640
I didn't do it. Trust me.

385
00:28:53,640 --> 00:28:55,040
You didn't?

386
00:28:55,120 --> 00:28:57,320
I didn't. I dare not.

387
00:28:57,400 --> 00:28:58,680
- I dare not.
- You wretch!

388
00:29:00,160 --> 00:29:01,240
Heng'e.

389
00:29:01,320 --> 00:29:02,960
What did you do?

390
00:29:04,560 --> 00:29:08,760
What did your brother do to offend you

391
00:29:09,360 --> 00:29:11,880
that you threw away all conscience?

392
00:29:11,960 --> 00:29:13,440
Speak!

393
00:29:16,880 --> 00:29:17,840
Lv Lun.

394
00:29:18,880 --> 00:29:20,600
When Wei Rao was kidnapped back then,

395
00:29:22,000 --> 00:29:23,840
was Wei Heng'e really the mastermind?

396
00:29:24,440 --> 00:29:26,680
It was Lady Heng'e
who bought the wet nurse off

397
00:29:26,760 --> 00:29:28,360
and stole the child.

398
00:29:29,200 --> 00:29:31,320
My wife found out about this.

399
00:29:31,400 --> 00:29:34,400
She wanted to blackmail her
for some money,

400
00:29:34,480 --> 00:29:36,640
but Lady Heng'e was more cunning.

401
00:29:36,720 --> 00:29:39,720
She found that my wife
had once falsified fiscal accounts

402
00:29:40,320 --> 00:29:42,000
and used it to blackmail us instead.

403
00:29:42,600 --> 00:29:46,000
She forced us to get rid of Lady Rao.

404
00:29:47,480 --> 00:29:48,320
How?

405
00:29:49,240 --> 00:29:52,000
She wanted us
to drown her in quick lime water.

406
00:30:09,560 --> 00:30:11,920
You can't bring yourself to do it?

407
00:30:12,000 --> 00:30:13,520
I'll do it.

408
00:30:19,920 --> 00:30:21,080
Give her to me!

409
00:30:27,360 --> 00:30:28,520
How dare you!

410
00:30:30,560 --> 00:30:32,920
Both of us were avaricious,

411
00:30:33,520 --> 00:30:35,720
but we never intended to harm anyone.

412
00:30:36,520 --> 00:30:42,360
Throwing a child into boiling limewater
is something even a beast can't do.

413
00:30:42,440 --> 00:30:43,520
But if we did not do that,

414
00:30:43,600 --> 00:30:45,360
we had no explanation for Lady Heng'e.

415
00:30:45,440 --> 00:30:48,040
I had no choice but to be ruthless
and left the child

416
00:30:48,120 --> 00:30:49,320
on the mountain at night.

417
00:30:49,920 --> 00:30:50,960
Next, I went to an orphanage

418
00:30:51,040 --> 00:30:53,000
to find the body of a child
who died of illness

419
00:30:53,080 --> 00:30:55,160
- and report back to Lady Heng'e.
- Shut up!

420
00:30:56,800 --> 00:30:58,800
So what if you didn't do it yourself?

421
00:30:59,680 --> 00:31:02,160
If I hadn't gone
to the mountains that night,

422
00:31:02,240 --> 00:31:04,360
the child would have been frozen to death.

423
00:31:06,160 --> 00:31:08,640
Later,

424
00:31:09,320 --> 00:31:12,120
Lady Heng'e brought a girl back

425
00:31:12,200 --> 00:31:15,240
and said she was
Lady Rao of the Duke's Residence.

426
00:31:15,320 --> 00:31:18,680
As for how she found the girl,

427
00:31:18,760 --> 00:31:20,600
I really don't know.

428
00:31:21,280 --> 00:31:22,400
I really don't.

429
00:31:28,400 --> 00:31:29,320
Everyone.

430
00:31:29,840 --> 00:31:31,040
Is that so hard to figure out?

431
00:31:31,120 --> 00:31:34,080
Wei Rao and Jundai
do look very much alike.

432
00:31:34,720 --> 00:31:36,240
There can't be such a coincidence
in this world.

433
00:31:37,600 --> 00:31:40,160
However, Wei Heng'e
treated Jundai like her own child

434
00:31:40,960 --> 00:31:42,560
and didn't hesitate to kill
with a sword for Jundai's sake.

435
00:31:43,360 --> 00:31:45,040
Who else, besides Jundai's own mother,

436
00:31:46,480 --> 00:31:47,840
would do that?

437
00:31:52,960 --> 00:31:54,240
Old Madam Wei.

438
00:31:54,320 --> 00:31:57,000
Wei Heng'e is your daughter.

439
00:31:57,080 --> 00:32:00,240
You should know
Jundai's origin better than anyone else.

440
00:32:01,480 --> 00:32:02,600
The child?

441
00:32:05,560 --> 00:32:07,320
That illegitimate child?

442
00:32:09,920 --> 00:32:12,400
You gave birth to the child?

443
00:32:13,560 --> 00:32:16,920
Yes. I gave birth to her.

444
00:32:18,760 --> 00:32:22,320
Blame yourself for being biased.

445
00:32:22,400 --> 00:32:24,720
Brother fancied Zhou Fu,

446
00:32:24,800 --> 00:32:26,360
and you allowed him to turn down
his original marriage to marry her.

447
00:32:26,440 --> 00:32:30,560
However, I loved Sun
and agreed to marry him,

448
00:32:30,640 --> 00:32:32,920
yet you said he was just a poor scholar.

449
00:32:33,000 --> 00:32:37,360
You forced me to our ancestral home
on the outskirts to get an abortion.

450
00:32:37,880 --> 00:32:38,960
I would never do that.

451
00:32:39,520 --> 00:32:42,840
I did everything I could
to keep her alive.

452
00:32:43,720 --> 00:32:47,600
Hard as it is, you chose this road.

453
00:32:48,560 --> 00:32:50,000
Back then,

454
00:32:50,080 --> 00:32:54,280
I did give a chance
to that unfaithful man,

455
00:32:54,360 --> 00:32:58,840
but he said he would rather
take the money than you.

456
00:33:00,000 --> 00:33:01,880
You.

457
00:33:01,960 --> 00:33:05,640
You disgraceful and immoral wretch.

458
00:33:05,720 --> 00:33:08,320
You actually dared
to bring this wretched child

459
00:33:08,400 --> 00:33:10,440
back into the house.

460
00:33:10,520 --> 00:33:14,040
Why shouldn't I do that? Why shouldn't I?

461
00:33:15,120 --> 00:33:18,520
When Wei Rao was born,
the whole family celebrated.

462
00:33:18,600 --> 00:33:19,640
What about my daughter?

463
00:33:19,720 --> 00:33:21,680
A wretched child.

464
00:33:21,760 --> 00:33:25,040
I hid away in the remote countryside.

465
00:33:25,120 --> 00:33:27,400
I didn't even dare call a midwife.

466
00:33:27,480 --> 00:33:33,200
When Jundai was born, I had
to bite off the umbilical cord myself.

467
00:33:33,880 --> 00:33:35,920
It was so unfair to my child.

468
00:33:36,960 --> 00:33:40,280
Tell me why! How could you be so unfair?

469
00:33:40,360 --> 00:33:43,040
I won't accept this! I won't stand for it!

470
00:33:49,240 --> 00:33:52,240
So, you took away Wei Rao
and even tried to kill her.

471
00:33:53,920 --> 00:33:55,240
She is your niece.

472
00:33:56,320 --> 00:33:57,920
She is your brother's only child.

473
00:33:58,960 --> 00:34:00,440
If you had even the slightest decency,

474
00:34:01,040 --> 00:34:02,520
you wouldn't be so cruel.

475
00:34:04,200 --> 00:34:05,480
Lord Lu.

476
00:34:06,440 --> 00:34:07,720
You were born with a noble status.

477
00:34:07,800 --> 00:34:10,000
You're virtuous and upright. Good for you.

478
00:34:10,679 --> 00:34:13,239
My Jundai isn't as fortunate as you.

479
00:34:13,320 --> 00:34:15,480
She wasn't born
as the heiress of the Duke's Residence.

480
00:34:15,560 --> 00:34:20,120
A cuckoo lays its eggs

481
00:34:20,199 --> 00:34:21,840
in another bird's nest
to ensure posterity.

482
00:34:22,400 --> 00:34:24,320
If I hadn't done what I did,

483
00:34:24,400 --> 00:34:27,480
Jundai would have
stayed in the rural area forever

484
00:34:28,080 --> 00:34:31,360
and become a lowly illegitimate daughter.

485
00:34:32,080 --> 00:34:35,840
Without the status of a noble
and protection from her family,

486
00:34:35,920 --> 00:34:37,840
there wouldn't be a future for her.

487
00:34:37,920 --> 00:34:40,320
For the sake of my own child,

488
00:34:40,400 --> 00:34:42,120
I can't care about anything else.

489
00:34:44,000 --> 00:34:45,040
Actually…

490
00:34:45,880 --> 00:34:50,480
Actually, I never planned
to kill Rao initially.

491
00:34:51,639 --> 00:34:53,920
If anyone is to be blamed for all this,

492
00:34:54,520 --> 00:34:57,320
then it's your fault, Zhou Fu.

493
00:34:59,080 --> 00:35:00,120
My fault?

494
00:35:01,160 --> 00:35:02,160
At first,

495
00:35:02,720 --> 00:35:05,040
I had intended to give Rao away
to be raised by others.

496
00:35:05,680 --> 00:35:08,400
But you just wouldn't let her go.

497
00:35:08,480 --> 00:35:10,240
You ordered the imperial army,
searched the city

498
00:35:10,320 --> 00:35:12,720
and question everyone to find her.

499
00:35:12,800 --> 00:35:14,720
If you hadn't pushed so hard,

500
00:35:14,800 --> 00:35:16,280
the wet nurse wouldn't have panicked

501
00:35:16,360 --> 00:35:18,480
and pleaded with me to send her back home.

502
00:35:18,560 --> 00:35:22,120
I would never have been so ruthless
as to hire someone to kill Rao.

503
00:35:22,200 --> 00:35:23,520
Wei Heng'e.

504
00:35:24,320 --> 00:35:26,560
You are at fault for everything,

505
00:35:26,640 --> 00:35:28,360
and you're still trying to blame someone?

506
00:35:28,960 --> 00:35:30,920
- You animal!
- Oh my.

507
00:35:31,440 --> 00:35:33,520
You're an animal!

508
00:35:34,480 --> 00:35:36,880
What did I do to have

509
00:35:36,960 --> 00:35:42,240
such a selfish
and heartless daughter like you?

510
00:35:43,000 --> 00:35:46,320
I spared you in the beginning,

511
00:35:46,920 --> 00:35:51,320
and that ended up harming
my granddaughter in the end.

512
00:35:55,960 --> 00:35:57,000
Rao…

513
00:35:59,080 --> 00:36:01,960
I've let you down.

514
00:36:03,360 --> 00:36:04,600
I'm so ashamed.

515
00:36:05,280 --> 00:36:08,360
Too ashamed to face you.

516
00:36:10,080 --> 00:36:14,000
Mother. Calm down, Mother.

517
00:36:14,520 --> 00:36:15,760
After all, Heng'e was the one

518
00:36:15,840 --> 00:36:19,120
who was blinded by her selfish motives
and acted recklessly.

519
00:36:19,840 --> 00:36:20,960
You're not to be blamed.

520
00:36:21,960 --> 00:36:27,360
Her judgment was probably clouded
because she loves her daughter too much.

521
00:36:28,160 --> 00:36:29,000
Mother.

522
00:36:29,600 --> 00:36:32,560
Old Madam Wei, forgive me for being blunt.

523
00:36:33,600 --> 00:36:35,200
If you really cared
about your granddaughter,

524
00:36:36,400 --> 00:36:37,920
she would never be kidnapped.

525
00:36:38,760 --> 00:36:40,440
You would never confuse her
with the fake Wei Rao.

526
00:36:41,480 --> 00:36:43,880
After all, an impostor
can never be the real person.

527
00:36:44,560 --> 00:36:47,280
Perhaps no one
in the Earl of Cheng'an's Residence

528
00:36:48,000 --> 00:36:49,360
has truly cared for her.

529
00:36:50,720 --> 00:36:52,600
They are completely different.

530
00:36:52,680 --> 00:36:54,560
Their personalities
are like night and day.

531
00:36:55,600 --> 00:36:58,000
I've never gotten her wrong. Not once.

532
00:36:58,640 --> 00:37:00,400
You're her own flesh and blood.

533
00:37:01,360 --> 00:37:03,160
How could you make such a huge mistake?

534
00:37:05,440 --> 00:37:06,600
It's my mistake.

535
00:37:07,200 --> 00:37:12,360
I was drowning
in the pain of losing my son

536
00:37:12,440 --> 00:37:15,120
and neglected Rao.

537
00:37:18,880 --> 00:37:19,920
Bitao.

538
00:37:20,600 --> 00:37:22,200
The one who asked you
to swap the Lifelong Lock,

539
00:37:24,120 --> 00:37:25,960
was it really Wei Heng'e?

540
00:37:27,440 --> 00:37:29,080
What Lifelong Lock?

541
00:37:31,120 --> 00:37:33,200
I've never swapped something
called Lifelong Lock.

542
00:37:34,960 --> 00:37:36,000
All of you.

543
00:37:36,600 --> 00:37:38,560
Don't celebrate too early.

544
00:37:40,240 --> 00:37:43,120
Back then, it was snowing.

545
00:37:43,840 --> 00:37:46,920
The child was abandoned
on the desolate rear hill.

546
00:37:47,440 --> 00:37:49,680
Perhaps she was already frozen to death.

547
00:37:49,760 --> 00:37:51,520
Perhaps that child didn't survive.

548
00:37:52,560 --> 00:37:54,160
Jundai is a fake.

549
00:37:54,240 --> 00:37:56,680
This woman might
not be the real thing either.

550
00:37:56,760 --> 00:37:58,440
She didn't have any evidence.

551
00:37:58,520 --> 00:38:00,840
She's just an impostor!

552
00:38:01,840 --> 00:38:02,720
My Lord.

553
00:38:03,240 --> 00:38:06,400
We must never show mercy
to a vicious woman like her.

554
00:38:07,080 --> 00:38:08,200
Don't worry.

555
00:38:08,800 --> 00:38:10,640
I have my own ways
to make her speak the truth.

556
00:38:13,080 --> 00:38:14,600
My Lord, if you punish her severely,

557
00:38:15,560 --> 00:38:17,200
it would appear that
I am abusing my position.

558
00:38:18,160 --> 00:38:19,080
You are my wife.

559
00:38:19,680 --> 00:38:21,280
I'm willing to let you wield
my power and influence.

560
00:38:22,360 --> 00:38:23,600
Let's see who dares defy me.

561
00:38:25,640 --> 00:38:26,760
And who dares object to me?

562
00:38:30,280 --> 00:38:32,320
I do have something to ask Aunt Yufeng.

563
00:38:35,840 --> 00:38:37,600
Why did you ask Jundai to poison me?

564
00:38:39,840 --> 00:38:43,320
And why did you kill Jundai in the end?

565
00:38:44,480 --> 00:38:45,320
What did you say?

566
00:38:58,080 --> 00:39:00,040
I tried to kill Jundai with poison?

567
00:39:01,200 --> 00:39:03,040
How did this come about?

568
00:39:03,120 --> 00:39:04,760
Aunt Heng'e is a daughter married out.

569
00:39:05,280 --> 00:39:07,160
She has no absolute power in Wei family.

570
00:39:07,760 --> 00:39:09,560
Buying off a wet nurse
and a guard was easy,

571
00:39:09,640 --> 00:39:11,480
but swap Jundai into the family
was rather difficult.

572
00:39:12,360 --> 00:39:14,720
Grandmother could not make
a sound decision after losing her son.

573
00:39:15,400 --> 00:39:17,160
She lay in her bed all day.

574
00:39:17,240 --> 00:39:21,040
All of Wei Residence
was under your control, Aunt Yufeng.

575
00:39:21,120 --> 00:39:23,280
If she brought in an impostor,

576
00:39:23,360 --> 00:39:25,800
how could it fool you,
the lady of Wei Residence?

577
00:39:30,760 --> 00:39:33,240
You had many
close servants in your courtyard.

578
00:39:33,320 --> 00:39:36,160
Were they all blind
and couldn't recognize anyone?

579
00:39:37,520 --> 00:39:38,480
Unless…

580
00:39:39,080 --> 00:39:41,960
Old Madam Wei, every servant
in Wei Rao's chamber was replaced

581
00:39:42,480 --> 00:39:43,760
after the incident.

582
00:39:43,840 --> 00:39:44,680
Am I right?

583
00:39:54,000 --> 00:39:54,960
Lady Li,

584
00:39:55,560 --> 00:39:59,040
Back then, His Majesty's love for you
made him furious.

585
00:39:59,120 --> 00:40:01,200
He blamed our Wei family
for failing to look after the child.

586
00:40:01,800 --> 00:40:03,680
We nearly lost our noble title.

587
00:40:03,760 --> 00:40:06,800
So all the servants were scapegoats.

588
00:40:06,880 --> 00:40:11,320
They were either sold to faraway places
or banished to the estate.

589
00:40:12,240 --> 00:40:13,720
When Jundai returned,

590
00:40:13,800 --> 00:40:17,080
those who served her
were taught by the Old Madam

591
00:40:17,160 --> 00:40:20,120
to prevent any mistakes
from happening again.

592
00:40:20,680 --> 00:40:22,560
Or, we can't explain
to the imperial court.

593
00:40:23,160 --> 00:40:25,280
Replacing all the previous servants
for no reason.

594
00:40:25,800 --> 00:40:27,360
Obviously, you were up to something.

595
00:40:32,280 --> 00:40:33,360
Aunt Heng'e.

596
00:40:33,440 --> 00:40:35,920
Only Jundai and I were in the room.

597
00:40:36,000 --> 00:40:37,760
Why would I do something
so foolish to poison her there?

598
00:40:38,360 --> 00:40:39,520
Think carefully.

599
00:40:40,200 --> 00:40:43,000
Who told Jundai to come to my room
with the poisonous wine?

600
00:40:43,520 --> 00:40:47,120
Who, once again, would see Jundai and I
cut each other down?

601
00:40:48,000 --> 00:40:51,720
On the surface, the person is helping
you and Jundai out of trouble

602
00:40:51,800 --> 00:40:55,280
but really, he's leading you step by step
into the deep end.

603
00:40:56,520 --> 00:40:57,640
Guo Yufeng.

604
00:40:59,800 --> 00:41:01,280
It was you?

605
00:41:02,280 --> 00:41:05,960
You were the one who incited Jundai
to poison Wei Rao?

606
00:41:06,960 --> 00:41:08,760
It was you who killed my daughter.

607
00:41:13,240 --> 00:41:14,600
I'm going to kill you!

608
00:41:14,680 --> 00:41:16,600
I'm going to kill you, Guo Yufeng!

609
00:41:16,680 --> 00:41:18,960
Give me back my daughter! Give her back!

610
00:41:19,040 --> 00:41:21,000
Let me go!

611
00:41:21,080 --> 00:41:23,880
- Give her back to me!
- Lady Guo.

612
00:41:23,960 --> 00:41:28,560
What's in it for you
if Wei Rao and Jundai destroy each other?

613
00:41:29,440 --> 00:41:33,520
What did Jundai do to you
that you wanted to kill her?

614
00:41:34,040 --> 00:41:36,200
If Wei Rao had been poisoned to death,

615
00:41:36,800 --> 00:41:38,320
when the truth is revealed,

616
00:41:38,840 --> 00:41:42,000
and Lady Li comes to know the facts,
she will be beside herself with grief.

617
00:41:42,760 --> 00:41:43,680
If Jundai was killed,

618
00:41:45,000 --> 00:41:48,320
Wei Rao would die
by her own mother's hands.

619
00:41:49,520 --> 00:41:51,040
Lady Li abandoned her own daughter
and then took her life.

620
00:41:51,920 --> 00:41:53,720
by what right will she ever stand
in the world?

621
00:41:54,640 --> 00:41:57,480
The moral conduct of an imperial consort
is there for everyone to see.

622
00:41:58,080 --> 00:42:01,280
The position and power she possesses
will all go down the drain.

623
00:42:02,880 --> 00:42:06,200
Kill the daughter first,
and then get rid of the mother.

624
00:42:06,800 --> 00:42:09,080
I've seen many schemes on the battlefield,

625
00:42:09,160 --> 00:42:13,960
but I've never seen
such a nefarious psychological ploy.

626
00:42:20,040 --> 00:42:21,200
Guo Yufeng.

627
00:42:22,640 --> 00:42:25,120
It is not Jundai you are after.

628
00:42:27,240 --> 00:42:28,800
Not even Wei Rao.

629
00:42:32,560 --> 00:42:37,440
What you truly seek
is to destroy my very soul, isn't it?

630
00:42:59,200 --> 00:43:00,200
How clever of you.

631
00:43:03,720 --> 00:43:05,240
Let me ask you then.

632
00:43:06,720 --> 00:43:10,720
How did you know
that I was trying to poison Jundai

633
00:43:11,400 --> 00:43:12,600
instead of you?

634
00:43:13,400 --> 00:43:14,920
Because you let Bitao to pour the wine.

635
00:43:16,080 --> 00:43:17,440
She has been by my side every day.

636
00:43:18,040 --> 00:43:19,040
She might betray me,

637
00:43:20,360 --> 00:43:23,800
but she is kind and
will never intend to kill me.

638
00:43:28,120 --> 00:43:31,400
My Lady, I've let you down.

639
00:43:32,320 --> 00:43:34,840
I swapped the Lifelong Lock.

640
00:43:35,760 --> 00:43:38,320
<i>I did it when you headed</i>
<i>to the Wei Residence.</i>

641
00:43:43,520 --> 00:43:45,960
The real Lifelong Lock

642
00:43:46,040 --> 00:43:49,440
must be in the hands of Governess Zheng
in Lady Guo's chamber.

643
00:43:51,960 --> 00:43:52,800
Search her chamber.

644
00:43:56,000 --> 00:43:57,400
Guo Yufeng.

645
00:43:58,240 --> 00:44:00,680
You deserve to die a cruel death!

646
00:44:00,760 --> 00:44:03,840
You've been using me all this while.

647
00:44:04,680 --> 00:44:07,440
When I was blackmailing the Changs,

648
00:44:08,000 --> 00:44:10,680
she purposely rushed in
and foiled my plan.

649
00:44:11,280 --> 00:44:13,360
I was forced to kneel and beg her.

650
00:44:13,440 --> 00:44:16,680
I had to give up many of my assets

651
00:44:17,960 --> 00:44:20,600
so she promised to help me keep secrets.

652
00:44:21,560 --> 00:44:25,480
So it was all a setup, all your game.

653
00:44:25,560 --> 00:44:31,520
I, the poor Wei Rao, and Jundai
were all living inside your trap.

654
00:44:33,040 --> 00:44:34,480
You and your daughter.

655
00:44:35,800 --> 00:44:40,240
One is selfish and greedy,
while the other is arrogant and brazen.

656
00:44:41,440 --> 00:44:43,240
Blame yourselves instead.

657
00:44:47,480 --> 00:44:49,960
I actually envy you.

658
00:44:50,680 --> 00:44:53,720
That daughter you've never
raised and educated

659
00:44:54,840 --> 00:44:56,640
actually turns out to be so intelligent.

660
00:44:56,720 --> 00:45:00,600
She even found you a heroic son-in-law,

661
00:45:01,200 --> 00:45:04,200
who will take the greatest risk
in the world for her.

662
00:45:05,520 --> 00:45:07,760
Go against an imperial decree.
Refuse to meet His Majesty.

663
00:45:09,160 --> 00:45:13,000
For her, he even wiped out
a whole bandit's hideout.

664
00:45:19,360 --> 00:45:21,960
If he were late by just a little,

665
00:45:23,360 --> 00:45:25,880
just a little bit,

666
00:45:27,320 --> 00:45:29,000
given your vicious personality,

667
00:45:29,080 --> 00:45:31,960
your daughter would
surely die in your hands.

668
00:45:32,560 --> 00:45:33,560
What a pity.

669
00:45:34,320 --> 00:45:36,760
What a huge pity.

670
00:45:39,080 --> 00:45:41,320
I'll rip you apart!

671
00:45:49,200 --> 00:45:50,720
Why do you hate her so much?

672
00:45:52,120 --> 00:45:56,560
Why don't you ask your mother
what she did?

673
00:45:56,640 --> 00:45:57,680
Shut up.

674
00:45:57,760 --> 00:46:00,920
Your ears mustn't be sullied
by the words of a crazy woman.

675
00:46:01,000 --> 00:46:02,200
Seal her mouth shut.

676
00:46:02,280 --> 00:46:04,120
- Stop her from spouting nonsense.
- What?

677
00:46:04,720 --> 00:46:05,480
Are you afraid?

678
00:46:06,080 --> 00:46:07,960
Afraid I'll expose your daughter

679
00:46:08,040 --> 00:46:11,280
in front of everyone and shame her?

680
00:46:12,240 --> 00:46:15,560
A woman who abandoned
her husband and daughter.

681
00:46:15,640 --> 00:46:17,760
Everyone in the world
knows what she's like.

682
00:46:18,720 --> 00:46:22,200
Wei Rao will see her true colors
sooner or later.

683
00:46:23,720 --> 00:46:27,240
- Shut up!
- She can't hide it from anyone else!

684
00:46:27,840 --> 00:46:29,560
What can't I admit?

685
00:46:30,520 --> 00:46:32,160
I have never feared the tongues of others.

686
00:46:32,720 --> 00:46:33,560
Guo Yufeng.

687
00:46:34,400 --> 00:46:37,160
You hate me so much
and took revenge against me.

688
00:46:37,680 --> 00:46:40,560
Isn't it because of
your marriage agreement with Wei Jin?

689
00:46:41,520 --> 00:46:43,600
He willingly turned down
the agreement to marry me.

690
00:46:44,200 --> 00:46:45,800
It's all the man's fault,

691
00:46:46,320 --> 00:46:48,720
yet you took out your hatred on me.

692
00:46:50,880 --> 00:46:52,160
It's all my fault.

693
00:46:53,080 --> 00:46:56,120
I pitied you back then

694
00:46:56,200 --> 00:46:58,080
and allowed you to marry
into the Wei residence.

695
00:46:59,480 --> 00:47:05,440
I thought I could save your life
and stop the others from badmouthing you,

696
00:47:06,240 --> 00:47:11,280
but I didn't expect
you to hold a grudge instead.

697
00:47:13,680 --> 00:47:15,400
Save my life?

698
00:47:16,800 --> 00:47:19,040
You ruined my whole life!

699
00:47:20,280 --> 00:47:23,560
Do you think
everyone wanted to marry your banal,

700
00:47:23,640 --> 00:47:25,680
perverted eldest son?

701
00:47:25,760 --> 00:47:28,480
Taking another glance at him
makes me sick!

702
00:47:30,280 --> 00:47:32,920
Don't forget. Your family was the one

703
00:47:33,000 --> 00:47:35,560
that went back on your promise
and voided my marriage agreement.

704
00:47:35,640 --> 00:47:38,240
It was your dotage and folly that
allowed Zhou Fu into this family.

705
00:47:38,320 --> 00:47:40,680
That was the cause of everything
that happened today.

706
00:47:44,280 --> 00:47:47,520
If you have a grudge, just come at me.

707
00:47:50,160 --> 00:47:54,320
- Why would you hurt the innocent children?
- Zhou Fu,

708
00:47:55,320 --> 00:47:56,400
you are smart,

709
00:47:58,200 --> 00:47:59,240
cold,

710
00:48:00,800 --> 00:48:02,480
and consumed by the desire for power.

711
00:48:03,800 --> 00:48:08,440
You think you're above everyone
and invincible.

712
00:48:09,360 --> 00:48:13,200
A woman's greatest weakness
is her children.

713
00:48:13,280 --> 00:48:14,880
You are a mother, after all.

714
00:48:14,960 --> 00:48:19,200
If your daughter dies, you will feel pain.

715
00:48:20,400 --> 00:48:24,280
If you were a little more careless,
she would die by your hands.

716
00:48:24,800 --> 00:48:28,520
That kind of pain is a pain
that tears at your heart and bones,

717
00:48:28,600 --> 00:48:30,520
so unbearable that
you would rather be dead.

718
00:48:30,600 --> 00:48:33,440
Every other form of revenge
pales in comparison.

719
00:48:34,560 --> 00:48:36,760
I am above such petty retaliation.

720
00:48:41,240 --> 00:48:42,440
Guards!

721
00:48:43,680 --> 00:48:45,000
Take her away!

722
00:49:50,120 --> 00:49:51,760
Lady Li loves her daughter too much.

723
00:49:52,760 --> 00:49:53,920
That's why she was misled.

724
00:49:55,440 --> 00:49:56,480
Even then,

725
00:49:57,400 --> 00:49:59,440
she never really had it in her to do it.

726
00:50:01,040 --> 00:50:05,320
You have always been
the daughter she loves dearly.

727
00:50:07,000 --> 00:50:07,840
Is that so?

728
00:50:20,600 --> 00:50:21,440
Mingzhu.

729
00:50:22,440 --> 00:50:23,440
No.

730
00:50:24,480 --> 00:50:25,320
Rao.

731
00:50:27,160 --> 00:50:28,760
I am your mother.

732
00:50:28,840 --> 00:50:29,760
Mother…

733
00:50:31,440 --> 00:50:32,480
Mother.

734
00:50:34,480 --> 00:50:37,520
Then how could a mother
not recognize her own child?

735
00:50:39,480 --> 00:50:40,880
If it were possible…

736
00:50:42,920 --> 00:50:45,200
I would rather you never gave birth to me.

737
00:50:50,040 --> 00:50:50,960
Rao.

738
00:50:53,920 --> 00:50:55,040
Rao!

739
00:50:55,720 --> 00:50:59,240
GUANYUN HALL

740
00:50:59,320 --> 00:51:00,840
Rao!

741
00:51:02,000 --> 00:51:03,280
Rao!

742
00:51:07,680 --> 00:51:09,000
Rao!

743
00:51:12,120 --> 00:51:13,800
Rao!

744
00:51:18,200 --> 00:51:19,720
Don't push her too far.

745
00:51:22,400 --> 00:51:23,720
Get yourself together!

746
00:51:24,320 --> 00:51:25,240
Listen to Lu Zhuo.

747
00:51:26,600 --> 00:51:27,520
All right.

748
00:51:27,600 --> 00:51:29,880
I won't push her. I won't.

749
00:51:30,520 --> 00:51:31,360
Go with her quickly.

750
00:51:32,040 --> 00:51:34,160
Bring her back safely. All right?

751
00:51:40,240 --> 00:51:43,560
Had you known how it'd end,
you wouldn't have done it.

752
00:52:11,440 --> 00:52:12,520
Mother!

753
00:52:12,600 --> 00:52:13,680
- You useless thing!
- Stop it!

754
00:52:13,760 --> 00:52:14,720
Get lost!

755
00:52:16,480 --> 00:52:17,560
You sickly wretch!

756
00:52:17,640 --> 00:52:19,320
Mother!

757
00:52:53,080 --> 00:52:53,920
Where are you going?

758
00:52:56,760 --> 00:52:57,600
What's scaring you?

759
00:52:59,400 --> 00:53:00,400
Afraid I'll end it all?

760
00:53:03,720 --> 00:53:04,560
I won't.

761
00:53:05,360 --> 00:53:08,560
Even if everyone hates me and abandons me,

762
00:53:09,920 --> 00:53:11,120
I won't take my own life.

763
00:53:12,600 --> 00:53:14,440
- Come back with me.
- No!

764
00:53:15,920 --> 00:53:17,000
I'm not going back there.

765
00:53:17,600 --> 00:53:19,400
I want to be back to my own place.

766
00:53:20,120 --> 00:53:21,800
You don't even know where you are going.

767
00:53:21,880 --> 00:53:23,400
You won't arrive anywhere like this.

768
00:53:23,920 --> 00:53:26,720
- Let go of me. Let go!
- I'll take you there.

769
00:53:27,440 --> 00:53:29,400
Let go of me!

770
00:53:29,480 --> 00:53:31,920
Let go!

771
00:53:37,280 --> 00:53:38,640
Lord Lu!

772
00:53:41,160 --> 00:53:43,720
Why are you still so foolish?

773
00:53:44,480 --> 00:53:46,120
I've never loved you.

774
00:53:46,200 --> 00:53:48,520
Not even a day, an hour, or a minute.

775
00:53:48,600 --> 00:53:49,840
I've always been using you!

776
00:53:53,160 --> 00:53:55,440
You are just the same
as Han Liao and Qi Zhongkai.

777
00:53:56,160 --> 00:53:58,120
You are just a stepping stone for me.

778
00:53:58,800 --> 00:54:00,080
You knew it exactly

779
00:54:00,680 --> 00:54:02,360
yet you still rushed headlong into it.

780
00:54:03,360 --> 00:54:04,400
Then you are a fool.

781
00:54:05,440 --> 00:54:07,360
If you have even a bit of dignity,

782
00:54:08,360 --> 00:54:09,880
you should stop clinging to me.

783
00:54:33,200 --> 00:54:34,800
What are you doing?

784
00:54:36,320 --> 00:54:37,800
I knew you were a cold woman.

785
00:54:38,320 --> 00:54:39,520
